{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Robot Lord Rising",
    "steam_appid": 1420120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/6d2588fa59aedf3d5d936b502694fb18.avif?t=1728293638\" /></div><strong>Grab a character, some battle cards, and let\u2019s go! There are bosses to be killed, cards to be collected, awards to be earned, and friends to be \u201caccidentally\u201d pushed into lava! If you like co-op games, but also want to build the kickassiest deck to wow your friends, RLR is not to be missed! Oh, and it has Story mode and VS as well, so when you are tired of co-op you can delve into the story by yourself, or remove the passiveness from your aggression and duke it out in full on versus mode! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/053159d176e23ae03a254bf31698c686.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/053159d176e23ae03a254bf31698c686.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/053159d176e23ae03a254bf31698c686.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIMED ACTION GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steer your character by playing action cards. The cards might activate movement, attacks, buffs, or other effects. But the time to plan is short, and you need to act fast! You only get 30 seconds to play as many cards as you can, and you all play at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/243728c2a83af473eb97a337de26bfdc.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/243728c2a83af473eb97a337de26bfdc.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/243728c2a83af473eb97a337de26bfdc.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BIG BOT WARNED YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're cool, you avoid the enormous red fields on the ground. At the end of the round there's going to be some hurtin' here. If you're hot and angry, you take in the face and swing away! Try it out, see what's best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/e9f6d6abad82a01758de0a6c46e8690a.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/e9f6d6abad82a01758de0a6c46e8690a.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/e9f6d6abad82a01758de0a6c46e8690a.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SUPER EARLY, BARELY ACCESS, CAN\u2019T WAIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are very early in development, so you\u2019ll have to look forward to a lot of features for a while. But if you help us make this a success (by playing the demo, and engaging with us), you get to be the one who was on board from the beginning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/12b4d2133ecacd1e2cd2e270bfa02195.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/12b4d2133ecacd1e2cd2e270bfa02195.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/12b4d2133ecacd1e2cd2e270bfa02195.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><i>Right now, you can play 2 different characters with their basic decks against the robot lord  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>TOXIC BASTARD. You can play up to 4 players.</i> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/6d2588fa59aedf3d5d936b502694fb18.avif?t=1728293638\" /></div><strong>Grab a character, some battle cards, and let\u2019s go! There are bosses to be killed, cards to be collected, awards to be earned, and friends to be \u201caccidentally\u201d pushed into lava! If you like co-op games, but also want to build the kickassiest deck to wow your friends, RLR is not to be missed! Oh, and it has Story mode and VS as well, so when you are tired of co-op you can delve into the story by yourself, or remove the passiveness from your aggression and duke it out in full on versus mode! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/053159d176e23ae03a254bf31698c686.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/053159d176e23ae03a254bf31698c686.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/053159d176e23ae03a254bf31698c686.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIMED ACTION GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steer your character by playing action cards. The cards might activate movement, attacks, buffs, or other effects. But the time to plan is short, and you need to act fast! You only get 30 seconds to play as many cards as you can, and you all play at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/243728c2a83af473eb97a337de26bfdc.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/243728c2a83af473eb97a337de26bfdc.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/243728c2a83af473eb97a337de26bfdc.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BIG BOT WARNED YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're cool, you avoid the enormous red fields on the ground. At the end of the round there's going to be some hurtin' here. If you're hot and angry, you take in the face and swing away! Try it out, see what's best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/e9f6d6abad82a01758de0a6c46e8690a.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/e9f6d6abad82a01758de0a6c46e8690a.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/e9f6d6abad82a01758de0a6c46e8690a.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SUPER EARLY, BARELY ACCESS, CAN\u2019T WAIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are very early in development, so you\u2019ll have to look forward to a lot of features for a while. But if you help us make this a success (by playing the demo, and engaging with us), you get to be the one who was on board from the beginning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/12b4d2133ecacd1e2cd2e270bfa02195.poster.avif?t=1728293638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/12b4d2133ecacd1e2cd2e270bfa02195.webm?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420120/extras/12b4d2133ecacd1e2cd2e270bfa02195.mp4?t=1728293638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><i>Right now, you can play 2 different characters with their basic decks against the robot lord  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>TOXIC BASTARD. You can play up to 4 players.</i> </p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a arena battle game fueled by panic and humor! Fight daunting robot bosses on your couch or online with up to 4 players. Program your hero with action cards, and play nice with your friends! With 30 seconds on the clock each round, you need to be fast and tactical! Fastical!",
